{
  "episode_id": "2026-10-01",
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "听众朋友大家好，欢迎收听AI每日先锋，今天是2026年10月1日国庆节，我是苏晴。",
      "start": 1.0,
      "duration": 8.316,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_001_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "大家好，我是周航。苏晴，国庆快乐呀。",
      "start": 9.765,
      "duration": 3.004,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_002_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "国庆快乐！我跟你说，虽然放假，但这科技圈是一点没消停。",
      "start": 13.266,
      "duration": 5.747,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_003_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "那可不。这两天AI圈最火的一个词你知道是什么吗？",
      "start": 19.466,
      "duration": 4.702,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_004_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "多智能体协作嘛。",
      "start": 24.573,
      "duration": 1.654,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_005_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对。但今天咱们要聊的这几件事，都在指向一个判断——AI竞争的下半场，拼的不再是模型参数了，是智能体基础设施。",
      "start": 26.66,
      "duration": 9.535,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_006_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这个我感触特别深。感觉大模型刚卷完一轮，又开始卷Agent了，而且这次卷的方向完全不一样。",
      "start": 36.66,
      "duration": 8.272,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_007_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，OpenAI那边推理领域的大佬最近有个访谈，看完我整个人都愣了一下。他说了个什么观点呢？原话大概是——数学只是多智能体时代的开胃菜。",
      "start": 45.394,
      "duration": 11.799,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_008_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这也太敢说了吧。数学可是硬骨头啊。",
      "start": 57.644,
      "duration": 4.18,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_009_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，他的意思是，哪怕是千禧年数学难题这种级别的硬核任务，你搞一万个Agent去协作，能贡献的功劳也就10%左右。剩下的90%还得靠人的直觉和洞察。",
      "start": 62.324,
      "duration": 13.603,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_010_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说我看到这段的时候脑子里蹦出一个画面——一万个特别聪明的实习生围着你解题，结果发现真正关键的那步还是得老板拍板。",
      "start": 76.365,
      "duration": 11.32,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_011_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你这个类比还挺到位的。说白了，Agent不是更强的计算器，它是一种全新的思维操作系统。",
      "start": 88.146,
      "duration": 6.531,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_012_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这个定位挺刷新我认知的。我之前一直觉得Agent就是帮人干活的工具，听完这访谈发现不对，它是要重新定义人和机器怎么分工。",
      "start": 95.122,
      "duration": 11.189,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_013_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "所以OpenAI内部对Agent的思考已经到了一个挺深的水位了。他们不追求让Agent去攻克数学难题，而是让它嵌入到人的思考流程里去。",
      "start": 106.785,
      "duration": 11.494,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_014_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这跟我们普通人有什么关系呢？",
      "start": 118.706,
      "duration": 2.656,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_015_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "关系大了。你想想，以后你工作里那些需要分步骤、跨工具、反复调整的复杂任务，Agent会变成你脑子的一部分，而不是外挂。",
      "start": 121.826,
      "duration": 10.014,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_016_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "明白了，就是从\"我让AI帮我做\"变成\"我和AI一起想\"。",
      "start": 132.257,
      "duration": 6.444,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_017_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，这个范式一旦转过来，很多产品形态都会变。",
      "start": 139.137,
      "duration": 4.093,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_018_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对了说到Agent基础设施，国内这边DeepSeek昨天在知乎发了篇独家文章，把V4.1 Agent训练用的那个弹性计算架构DSec全公开了。",
      "start": 143.647,
      "duration": 13.105,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_019_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这事儿我在朋友圈看到好多人转。说实话我有点意外，你想啊，现在各大厂商都在闭门造Agent，DeepSeek直接把自己最核心的训练方法论掀出来给大家看。",
      "start": 157.248,
      "duration": 11.295,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_020_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这格局一下子就上来了。我理解DeepSeek的意思是——我不仅模型强，我训练Agent的整套基础设施都强，而且我愿意让你们来验证。",
      "start": 168.955,
      "duration": 10.884,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_021_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意这个\"弹性计算\"四个字。它的意思是训练资源可以像云一样伸缩，根据Agent任务规模动态调配，这在以前是很少有人系统讲过的。",
      "start": 180.318,
      "duration": 11.102,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_022_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这种东西一旦被验证有效，其他厂商基本就得跟进，因为训练成本会差出好几倍。",
      "start": 191.852,
      "duration": 8.011,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_023_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，而且DeepSeek这次的发声时间点挺有意思的，正好在国产模型被国际市场反复验证的当口。",
      "start": 200.331,
      "duration": 7.88,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_024_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哎你说起国际市场认可这事，Anthropic最近是不是闹了个乌龙？",
      "start": 208.701,
      "duration": 5.616,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_025_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你知道了啊。Anthropic发了他们最新一代模型的实测对比，本意肯定是秀肌肉，结果测着测着网友发现，智谱的GLM-5.3在好几个核心维度上根本不输，甚至有些场景还更优。",
      "start": 214.794,
      "duration": 16.694,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_026_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这就是典型的反向带货啊。本来想踩别人，结果把别人抬上去了。",
      "start": 231.906,
      "duration": 5.355,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_027_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "说白了，这就是中国模型在国际赛场上的竞争力又得到了一次实打实的验证。而且不是我们自己吹，是友商帮忙测出来的。",
      "start": 237.7,
      "duration": 9.796,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_028_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我觉得这事最妙的地方在于，Anthropic肯定也委屈——我好好发个技术报告，怎么就给你做嫁衣了？",
      "start": 247.908,
      "duration": 8.185,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_029_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "行业就是这样的，你越藏着掖着，别人越觉得你心虚。开源和开放评测才是建立信任的最快路径。",
      "start": 256.586,
      "duration": 8.359,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_030_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "嗯，这个逻辑其实跟DeepSeek这次公开DSec是相通的。",
      "start": 265.354,
      "duration": 5.355,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_031_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，都是用透明度换话语权。那咱们再说说谷歌那边。",
      "start": 271.196,
      "duration": 6.095,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_032_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "谷歌DeepMind发布Gemini 4 Argon了对吧，这个名字取得挺有意思。",
      "start": 277.733,
      "duration": 6.139,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_033_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "Argon是氩气的意思，惰性气体。他们内部命名体系一贯有这套风格。这次的重点不是参数又大了多少，而是它在编码、推理、多模态三个维度上做了深度融合。",
      "start": 284.332,
      "duration": 13.516,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_034_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "你能不能给翻译翻译什么叫深度融合？",
      "start": 298.319,
      "duration": 3.57,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_035_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "简单说，你以前用AI写代码是一个窗口，做图是另一个窗口，分析数据又是第三个。Gemini 4 Argon想做到的是，你开一个窗口，这三件事能串起来自动跑完。",
      "start": 302.301,
      "duration": 12.689,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_036_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "所以它主打的场景是企业的长链条工作流？",
      "start": 315.435,
      "duration": 4.746,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_037_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，这就是它的目标客户群——企业里那种需要跨工具、跨部门、跑好几个环节才能完成的任务。比如从一份市场报告自动生成对应的可视化图表和后续的投放方案。",
      "start": 320.636,
      "duration": 12.95,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_038_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "听着确实省事，但企业落地最关心的还是安全和可控，这块谷歌怎么做的？",
      "start": 334.026,
      "duration": 6.618,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_039_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这个他们也提到了，Argon在企业部署里支持数据隔离和操作审计，本质上就是让企业敢用。",
      "start": 341.122,
      "duration": 8.925,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_040_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那对个人用户呢？",
      "start": 350.528,
      "duration": 1.48,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_041_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "个人用户能用到的能力是它的多模态理解更自然了。 比如你拍张复杂的产品说明书，它能直接帮你拆出操作步骤。",
      "start": 352.434,
      "duration": 8.969,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_042_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "行， 最后一条快讯，DeepMind还推出了SynthID Bio，给AI生成的蛋白质打水印。",
      "start": 361.873,
      "duration": 9.012,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_043_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这个技术我个人觉得意义被低估了。 你想啊，蛋白质设计和基因编辑现在发展太快了，万一实验室里分不清一个蛋白质是天然的还是AI设计的，后果是很严重的。",
      "start": 371.346,
      "duration": 12.253,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_044_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对， 相当于在AI生物领域装了个\"成分标签\"。",
      "start": 384.055,
      "duration": 4.484,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_045_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "而且技术难度很高，它要在不破坏蛋白质生物功能的前提下嵌入数字指纹，这个平衡点特别难找。 DeepMind能搞定这一步，说明AI for Science的工程能力又上了一个台阶。",
      "start": 389.005,
      "duration": 14.43,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_046_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说 我听完今天这几条新闻，最大的感受是——AI这行从拼\"谁模型大\"真的开始往\"谁基础设施全、谁协作范式新\"的方向走了。",
      "start": 403.868,
      "duration": 12.452,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_047_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "总结得到位。 咱们今天聊的这些其实都指向同一件事，Agent正在重塑整个技术栈，从训练到推理到应用，每一个环节都在被重新定义。",
      "start": 416.727,
      "duration": 11.32,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_048_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "好， 那今天的节目就先到这儿。我是苏晴。",
      "start": 428.517,
      "duration": 3.483,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_049_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "我是周航， 国庆假期愉快，咱们下期见。",
      "start": 432.401,
      "duration": 2.961,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_050_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "下期见！",
      "start": 435.773,
